1
00:00:00,531 --> 00:00:02,431
(Dan:)vicious little Bernadette.

2
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:04,663
(Penny:)Come on. She's not that bad.

3
00:00:04,668 --> 00:00:06,168
(Dan:)Oh, yeah?

4
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,340
(Dan:)At the company picnic
she yelled at me and my grandson

5
00:00:08,339 --> 00:00:10,539
(Dan:)for losing
the three-legged race.

6
00:00:10,541 --> 00:00:15,711
I mean, he still calls her "that
mean kid with the big boobies."

7
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:18,343
(Penny:)I know she can be
a little intense, but, I swear,

8
00:00:18,349 --> 00:00:20,579
(Penny:)she is so sweet
once you get past all the...
Hey,

9
00:00:20,584 --> 00:00:21,714
(Bernadette:)what are you
talking about?

10
00:00:21,719 --> 00:00:23,349
(Penny:)Oh. We were just talking

11
00:00:23,354 --> 00:00:25,454
(Penny:)about how much we love working
with you. Isn't that right?

12
00:00:25,456 --> 00:00:27,526
(Penny:)Dan?

13
00:00:30,594 --> 00:00:33,024
(Sheldon:)Over the years here
at Fun With Flags,

14
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:36,370
(Sheldon:)we've had an opportunity to
learn, laugh, wonder...

15
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:40,267
(Amy:)And, yes, even shed
a tear or two.

16
00:00:40,271 --> 00:00:44,111
(Sheldon:)Like when you do a two-hour
Fourth of July spectacular

17
00:00:44,108 --> 00:00:46,978
(Sheldon:)and it doesn't
get recorded.

18
00:00:46,977 --> 00:00:49,977
(Amy:)How many times do I have
to say I'm sorry?

19
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:53,080
How about 4,000.

20
00:00:53,083 --> 00:00:55,883
(Sheldon:)One for every domino I set up
to make that American flag.

21
00:00:57,254 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)Please enjoy
these highlights.

